    "description": {
      "value": "This elegant black, gold-tipped fighting fan is adorned with images of three golden leaves and a red rope tassel. If a creature is reduced to 0 Hit Points by a spirit fan, the golden leaves on the fan light up, providing illumination equal to that of a torch for 1 minute.\n\nActivate (2 Actions)\nFrequency: once per hour\nRequirements: The spirit fan's leaves are illuminated\nYou sweep the spirit fan in the direction of a single target you can see within 30 feet, releasing the life energy in the form of a streak of golden light. The spirit fan goes dark. If the target is a living creature, the energy restores 3d8+8 Hit Points. If the target is undead, it takes 2d8+8 positive damage (23 basic Fortitude save)."
    },
